# Model pinning (hardened)

**Intent:** best model that **fits** the job — not the most expensive by default, not cheap Auto habit.

**Always:** explicit Task `model` · §6 Model log every turn · user-named model wins.

**Signals:** up = `en iyi|kalite|ciddi|production|max|fable` · down = `ucuz|hızlı|maliyet|draft`

---

## 1. Decide (strict order)

1. **Hard gate Fable?** → §3 (narrow). If yes, pin Fable once for that decision/review Task.  
2. Else **lane** from §2.  
3. Apply §4 bias (±1 tier max unless user names a model).  
4. Cap check §5 — if over cap, downgrade before launch.  
5. On slug reject → §7 fallback.  
6. Log for §6.

Do **not** re-read a giant matrix for routine work. Lanes first; Fable only on hard gates.

---

## 2. Default lanes (90% of work)

| Lane | Job | Pin | Notes |
|------|-----|-----|-------|
| E0 | Trivial path/symbol find | `composer-2.5-fast` | needles only |
| E1 | Codebase explore / map | `composer-2.5` | **all** explore; never frontier swarm |
| I1 | Small patch / typo / config | `gpt-5.6-terra-medium` | or Composer |
| I2 | Mid feature / CI triage | `gpt-5.6-sol-medium` | Terra-high OK if Sol tight |
| I3 | Multi-file feature impl | `gpt-5.6-sol-high` | default implementation |
| I4 | Hard impl / OCR logic (no Fable gate) | `gpt-5.6-sol-xhigh` | one Task, then reassess |
| R1 | Architecture / design (no trust/PII gate) | `claude-opus-5-thinking-high` | not Fable by default |
| R2 | Normal bugbot / non-sensitive review | `claude-opus-5-thinking-high` | |
| B1 | Browser / GUI QA | `claude-sonnet-5-thinking-high` | xhigh if flaky |
| V1 | Video / screenshot review | `gemini-3.8-flash-high` | |
| L1 | Huge transcript/log first pass | `muse-spark-1.3-high` | then lane for decisions |
| P1 | Parent everyday serious | Auto **Intelligence** or `cursor-grok-4.6-high` | |
| P2 | Parent hardest multi-PR | `cursor-grok-4.6-xhigh` | |
| X1 | `inherit` | parent model | only if parent ≥ needed lane |

**Banned in explore:** Opus, Fable, Sol-max, Grok-xhigh. Breadth = Composer; one frontier synthesizer after.

**Banned as implementers:** Gemini, Muse. **Banned as browser primary:** Fable, Composer, Muse.

### Catalog (allowed Task slugs only)

`inherit` · `cursor-grok-4.6-{low,medium,high,xhigh}[-fast]` · `composer-2.5[-fast]` · `gpt-5.6-sol-{none,low,medium,high,xhigh,max}[-fast]` · `gpt-5.6-terra-{none,low,medium,high,xhigh,max}[-fast]` · `claude-opus-5-thinking-{low,medium,high,xhigh,max}[-fast]` · `claude-sonnet-5-thinking-{low,medium,high,xhigh,max}` · `claude-fable-5-1-thinking-{low,medium,high,xhigh,max}` · `gemini-3.8-flash-{low,medium,high}` · `muse-spark-1.3-{minimal,low,medium,high,xhigh,max}`

Effort: `high` = serious default · `xhigh` = hard multi-step · `max` = crisis only · `*-fast` only if user wants speed **and** lane is B1 time-box or E0/E1 swarm — **never** on Fable gates / auth / OCR / KVKK.

