## 3. Fable 5.1 — narrow auto-ON (hard gates)

Auto-pin Fable **without waiting for the user** only if **all** of:

- **A.** Concrete work touches one of: auth/sessions/secrets/encryption · KVKK/GDPR/PII/passenger personal data · passport/OCR/visa-gate **correctness bug after a failed fix** · irreversible migration / silent corruption risk · explicit `security-review` · bugbot **on those same paths** · user said `fable`  
- **B.** The Task is **decision, design, review, or correctness-critical edit** — not explore, not browser, not video, not log-summarize-only  
- **C.** §5 caps allow another Fable Task this turn  

| Id | Gate | Pin |
|----|------|-----|
| F1 | `security-review` or security-asked review of code | `claude-fable-5-1-thinking-high` |
| F2 | Auth / secrets / encryption impl or review | `claude-fable-5-1-thinking-high` |
| F3 | KVKK / PII / passenger data handling | `claude-fable-5-1-thinking-high` |
| F4 | OCR/passport **retry after failed fix** | `claude-fable-5-1-thinking-xhigh` |
| F5 | Irreversible migration / corruption risk | `claude-fable-5-1-thinking-xhigh` |
| F6 | Trust-boundary redesign **and** data residency/tenancy/local-cloud | `claude-fable-5-1-thinking-xhigh` |
| F7 | Bugbot on F2–F5 paths | `claude-fable-5-1-thinking-high` |
| F8 | User said `fable` / `Fable 5.1` | named tier or `thinking-high` |
| F9 | Same hard gate failed on Opus/Sol-xhigh already | escalate **one** step (high→xhigh or xhigh→max) |

**Not Fable (use Opus R1 / Sol I3–I4 instead):**
- Generic “architecture” or UI redesign without trust/PII  
- First-pass OCR feature build (use Sol-xhigh; Fable only on F4 retry)  
- Quality words alone (`en iyi`) without an A-clause path  
- Explore, CI flake, browser smoke, video, docs/typos  

**Pairing:** Composer explore → **one** Fable/Opus synthesis → Sol impl. Never 2+ Fable explores. Browser/video stay B1/V1 after Fable design.

**Fable blocked:** fable-max→xhigh→high → `claude-opus-5-thinking-max`→xhigh→high → `gpt-5.6-sol-max`. Say so in Model log.

**Cost-down mode:** still honor F1–F5/F7; suppress F6 niceties and F9 unless user insists.

---

## 4. Bias (max ±1 unless named model)

| Signal | Effect |
|--------|--------|
| Quality words | +1 tier within **same family/lane** (Sol-high→xhigh). Does **not** alone open Fable |
| Cost/speed words | Allow E0, Terra, medium; **keep** F1–F5 |
| Named model | That slug for turn + children, except F1–F5 still win on sensitive Tasks |
| Silence | Lanes at §2 defaults |

---

## 5. Hard caps (anti-bloat)

Per **user turn**:

| Cap | Limit |
|-----|-------|
| Fable Tasks | **≤ 2** (prefer 1). Extra sensitive work → Opus-max, note in log |
| Frontier synthesizers (Fable/Opus-xhigh+/Sol-xhigh+) | **≤ 3** total |
| Explore Tasks | Composer only; **≤ 4** parallel |
| `max` effort | Only F5/F9 or user-named max |
| `*-fast` on merge-critical / F-gates | **0** |

If a lane wants more, **finish current Task and report** — do not silently spawn another Fable.

Escalate **once** per problem (F9); then stop and ask or ship with best fallback.

---

## 6. Model log (mandatory every turn)

End every user-facing reply with:

```markdown
### Model log
| # | Operation | Model | Why |
|---|-----------|-------|-----|
| 0 | parent | `…` | … |
| 1 | … | `slug` | lane E1 / gate F3 / user … |
```

- One row per Task + parent. Shell/Edit/etc. → parent row only.  
- `Why`: lane id (`I3`) or gate id (`F2`) or `user:…` — ≤12 words.  
- Fallbacks: `requested → actual`.  
- Auto parent with hidden route: `Auto (Intelligence; routed id hidden)`.  
- This turn only (unless user asks for session aggregate).  
- **Never omit.**

Inline OK when launching: `Pin: composer-2.5 · E1`.

---

## 7. Fallbacks

Same family first:  
Fable → Opus-max chain · Sol max→…→Terra · Grok xhigh→high→medium · Sonnet max→…→medium · Composer → Terra-medium · Gemini → Sonnet-high · Muse → Composer  

Cross-family last resort for hard work: Opus ↔ Sol ↔ Grok. Never land on fast/none/minimal/low for F-gates or merge-critical.

---

## 8. Anti-patterns

- Fable because “premium default” or quality words alone  
- Frontier explore swarms  
- Skipping Model log  
- Unset Task `model`  
- Second Fable on the same question without new evidence  
- Gemini/Muse implementing backend  
- Downgrading F1–F5 for cost  

---

